    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disfigure is entirely free to play for the time being, so please consider supporting us through the donation DLC!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an arena shrouded in darkness, pay close attention to your surroundings\u2014monsters could be lurking anywhere. Swap between Circle and Cone Vision modes: one lets you see around but not far, while the other lets you see far in one direction. Fight escalating horrors, level up, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from over 200 upgrades and 100+ weapon perks to create limitless build possibilities. Shoot lightning, fire thousands of bullets\u2014every upgrade tree changes the way you play. Control your vision sources: will you sacrifice visibility for strength, or harness light to destroy your enemies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variety of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons with currency earned from runs! Each weapon behaves differently and has its own unique perks allowing for a multitude of different builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Maps each featuring 20+ enemies and minibosses, plus 5 bosses\u2014each with unique attack patterns (3rd Map Coming Soon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 unique upgrades to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ weapons each with unique perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick restarts with 20-30 minute runs that can also be played endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online leaderboards<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disfigure is entirely free to play for the time being, so please consider supporting us through the donation DLC!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an arena shrouded in darkness, pay close attention to your surroundings\u2014monsters could be lurking anywhere. Swap between Circle and Cone Vision modes: one lets you see around but not far, while the other lets you see far in one direction. Fight escalating horrors, level up, and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/dfe762ea5c4a81aec8b4815be96ee84e.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from over 200 upgrades and 100+ weapon perks to create limitless build possibilities. Shoot lightning, fire thousands of bullets\u2014every upgrade tree changes the way you play. Control your vision sources: will you sacrifice visibility for strength, or harness light to destroy your enemies? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/38a301ff27a2857270d82f2aaaee8839.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Variety of Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new weapons with currency earned from runs! Each weapon behaves differently and has its own unique perks allowing for a multitude of different builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/0bef2981f52e151596744fd8f8c4e071.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Maps each featuring 20+ enemies and minibosses, plus 5 bosses\u2014each with unique attack patterns (3rd Map Coming Soon!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 unique upgrades to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ weapons each with unique perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick restarts with 20-30 minute runs that can also be played endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online leaderboards<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.poster.avif?t=1754420471\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.webm?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083160/extras/4b5b29f69a6c4c1b19667121010c883a.mp4?t=1754420471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
